# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_42588> (4-hydroxyphenyl retinamide)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_42588> "A retinoid obtained by formal condensation of the carboxy group of <i>all</i>-<i>trans</i> retinoic acid and the anilino group of 4-hydroxyaniline. Synthetic retinoid agonist. Antiproliferative, antioxidant and anticancer agent with a long half-life in vivo. Apoptotic effects appear to be mediated by a mechanism distinct from that of 'classical' retinoids.")
