AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_4356> "An acyclic desferrioxamine that is butanedioic acid in which one of the carboxy groups undergoes formal condensation with the primary amino group of <em>N</em>-(5-aminopentyl)-<em>N</em>-hydroxyacetamide and the second carboxy group undergoes formal condensation with the hydroxyamino group of <em>N</em><small><sup>1</small></sup>-(5-aminopentyl)-<em>N</em><small><sup>1</small></sup>-hydroxy-<em>N</em><small><sup>4</small></sup>-[5-(hydroxyamino)pentyl]butanediamide. It is a siderophore native to <em>Streptomyces pilosus</em> biosynthesised by the DesABCD enzyme cluster as a high affinity Fe(III) chelator.")
